<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="e1971cbe">&lt;p&gt;
    The approach document presents the organization&apos;s strategy for the cutover and deployment.  It
    provides general direction set by leadership to guide the organization through a transition.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="6429c4ed"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="1ebde23d">&lt;p&gt;
    Development of a realistic approach is an important cutover and deployment activity.  When building the
    approach:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Use the organization’s operating model as a framework; check cutover and deployment activities against each
        part of the framework
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Engage business and technology subject matter resources to help build and confirm the approach
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="ecc268f0"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="ee2a0f62">To outline an organization&apos;s objectives and policies for effecting transition of new processes and
technologies into its operations.</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="8140523e"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="9f0d55f9"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="8ae5163b">&lt;p&gt;
    The approach documents guidance with which to plan and manage the business and technology aspects
    of a transition.  A brief outline of the approach includes:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Organization goals and tenets 
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Experience gained from previous transition events 
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communication protocols
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Business transition considerations
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Technology transition considerations
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Potential transition governance structure and processes
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="representationOptions" nodeId="5fe4ee51"></attribute>
<attribute name="representation" nodeId="eba3290d"></attribute>
<attribute name="notation" nodeId="c8b67a5b"></attribute>
